  "id": "ube-cheesecake",
  "name": "Ube Cheesecake",
  "subtitle": "A creamy purple cheesecake with a crisp graham crust and white chocolate topping.",
  "description": "Bake a lightly salted graham crust, fill it with ube cheesecake batter, chill until firm, and finish with a smooth white chocolate-ube topping.",
